 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000The second step is to check availability. Before you promise a room, you look at the computer to see if a room is free for those dates. If there is a room, you continue. If not, you must tell the guest politely and offer another date or another room type.":{f:"cf49557d55ed3bf9",d:16.656,v:0.670,a:0.160,b:15.760,wd:[0.2, 0.52, 0.87, 1.16, 1.28, 1.48, 1.89, 2.74, 3.28, 3.44, 3.8, 4.01, 4.37, 4.61, 4.92, 5.08, 5.36, 5.8, 6.16, 6.31, 6.49, 6.61, 6.92, 7.09, 7.4, 7.56, 8.0, 8.42, 8.68, 8.97, 9.15, 9.27, 9.72, 9.92, 10.48, 10.66, 10.96, 11.21, 11.44, 11.81, 12.16, 12.52, 12.84, 13.16, 13.56, 14.0, 14.35, 14.53, 15.01, 15.32],e:"00000WnQQesP0VWKILGJlcQ00STK0KR0OLjT0EUHdXTUQEceWVWKSPLG00000000000000000000000000-",w:"00---ih---fayZT9----abMZ-Jk---e---TOn-HePUHED4NaOLbLQQPRb-----0000000000000000----P---EENRXOG-uLMDBQ---KA9DJLNG6437v---GgbKWRW-XSeVUn-J93--SPhQO--s---ebP-IF98GJGBGW-----KQj--TJSUM----eUNKn----------0000000000000000---oU--SUJHW--OD89HIJGC83Bl--SjHo-qP8--aU8NWPC59+---00000000000000000---mW--8TRPQSUN------KN9BSW-----TJZgbEkiX----yIFJVbiY9ejblXd9SRPL--GKQCDXP-OM3-kjjeS--8DIOBLULUL96EGB6--qUQOJQ-y----00000000000000000",r:"--000JK000MR3SYs0000RQfS0iH000N000YdE0kNcXknoxeRdgQgbbcaQ00000----------------0000c000nneaUdl07gfoqb000hrsoigelvxyu6000lLQhWaW0UZNWXE0isy00ZcKbd009000NQc0jmstlilqlV00000hbI00YiZXf0000NXehE0000000000----------------000DX00ZXikW00dotskjilptyqG00ZIkD0Bct00RXteWcpws1000-----------------000FV00tYacbZXe000000hesqZW00000YiSLQnHJU00003jmiWQJTsNIQGUOsZacg00lhbpoUc0dfy0HIINZ00tojdqgXgXgsvnlqv00BXbdib030000-----------------"},
 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000The third step is to take the details. You ask for the guest's name, the dates, the room type, and the number of nights. You use polite requests: “Could I take your name?” and “Could you spell that, please?” Names and dates are easy to get wrong, so you repeat them and check. This is the most important step.":{f:"9492c5cd3ef249de",d:20.616,v:0.735,a:0.160,b:19.720,wd:[0.2, 0.36, 0.88, 1.14, 1.4, 1.42, 1.83, 2.08, 2.65, 2.9, 3.12, 3.4, 3.6, 4.08, 4.53, 4.68, 5.22, 5.4, 5.78, 6.16, 6.41, 6.66, 7.1, 7.24, 7.79, 8.04, 8.4, 8.8, 9.28, 9.68, 10.0, 10.24, 10.55, 11.0, 11.24, 11.68, 11.93, 12.36, 12.68, 13.24, 13.62, 13.76, 14.25, 14.5, 14.81, 14.96, 15.25, 15.69, 15.84, 16.13, 16.48, 16.88, 17.13, 17.57, 17.88, 18.07, 18.32, 18.52, 19.26],e:"-jPPWP0QdVUabPL0SUL00UdOMLFMK0TXNKE000000000000000000000000",w:"00---lT--MLKLC----ScSU-R---cj-yhqx-SE-YYT---XSKC9A---------0000000000000000---BcYEHYbX----LKWb9-agZ-----nQcjjZD33S---WG-XZheSQ---------XIBAIG96---SUSNKys----cNBWFBURC8EKLI-7IWUZWKUz---------00000000000000000---Xgeehe----KGDPbhR9GDcZWNWSS--------------SSkc--lq--LODLimncD5D----heXE-----T--Y---nNKIkcZSPPg------Ogpqqg----------------------------v2EosoKB-uZD6-olns-mOMIMZY--nk--h-UbK46DIKLIC528p------gefREEIE--jg--WcCDWE6---YdWQWd---------------------000----Ub--u--oKC9KNd--tC4osAIG66p---eXOMKd-s----00000000000000000",r:"--000GY00fghgp0000ZPZX0a000PI03KB40Zn0TTY000UZhpsr000000000----------------000qPTnkTQU0000ghWQs0RLS00000EbPIISoyyZ000Vl0USKNZb000000000Ujqrjlsv000ZXZeh390000PeqVmqXaptnhgj0ujWXSVhX2000000000-----------------000ULNNKN0000hlocQKasloPSWeVZZ00000000000000ZZHP00GB00gdogJFEPowo0000KNUn00000Y00T000EehjHPSZccL000000dLCBBL00000000000000000000000000006znD9Dhq07Sov0DGE90FdfjfST00EH00K0XQhxvojhgjpwztC000000LNMannjn00IL00VPpoVnv000TOWbWO000000000000000000000---0000XQ00700DhpsheO008pxD9rjlvvC000NUdfhO090000-----------------"},
